{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "623a11759737f42aff05170320aecedd4af96d5ae4027654bbc6ce0046c7f5d9", "ja": "レッスンの合間に……？", "zh": "课程的间隙……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2bd0250de8568039cd9214cc0e8faaedb54bd7518a771e8c987e9eb0f8ac6d70", "ja": "今日もアイドル達は、真剣にレッスン中……\nと思いきや、休憩時間にお菓子を食べて寛い\nでいた。春香、エレナ、エミリー、風花のそ\nんな様子がバッチリ録画されてしまい、少し\n慌てる一同。", "zh": "今天偶像们也在认真练习……\n本来以为是这样，没想到她们却在休息时间吃着零食\n悠闲地放松。春香、艾蕾娜、艾米莉、风花的这副\n模样被完整录了下来，大家都有些慌张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e7f62c8811761621be4befeb9e7d5d377a5c5a20b240d35be5912808fd388c15", "ja": "今回は、レッスンに臨むアイドル達の様子を見て\nみよう。邪魔にならないように、そっと……。", "zh": "这次去看看偶像们参加课程时的样子吧。为了不打扰她们，悄悄地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1001_null", "source_sha256": "98c4f4c41d27dc68b661af1a3092c05786d17e48d555e37eb565070ac24d04f5", "ja": "カッ、チャ……", "zh": "咔、嚓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "472a887ccc4bee9888e59bdf64b75fb442df7ccccca9c2851fbd2015cfd52a16", "ja": "ワオ！　エミリーのクッキー、\nすっごく美味しいヨ～！　モグモグ……♪", "zh": "哇！艾米莉的曲奇，\n超级好吃哟～！嚼嚼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "2c8ba9eee475f8e8328d941035c14c62a46001b049940334c4138a6ed68aebf6", "ja": "エレナさんの猪口令糖菓子も、とても美味です！\nもぐもぐ……♪", "zh": "艾丽娜小姐的巧克力点心也非常美味！\n嚼嚼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "361520c0d9d8a91714bb2086dbc91492537a2d3034da5389e5915cdeae2ca52a", "ja": "つい手が伸びちゃうよね♪　春香ちゃんのマカロンも\n本当に美味しくて……うぅ、また太っちゃいそう。", "zh": "总是忍不住伸手去拿呢♪　春香的马卡龙也\n真的很好吃……呜，又感觉要长胖了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "1db6487f3f885c6ef24d8a746f19202ee06e81edb25e7ae3c7148812a491fb85", "ja": "はっ……！\n{$P$}さん！？", "zh": "哈……！\n{$P$}先生！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "81c0f6056ace09cf8ca77385e7a6a27b6256444ee0e31f6267bbfddd51e46274", "ja": "仕掛け人さま！？\nあ、そちらの録画機械は、いったい……？", "zh": "幕后操控人！？  \n啊，说起来……您手上的那个录像设备，究竟是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "4c063ac16c97a7dd737ab90992195b07e5647c83bbb4a760cd601460f44d957a", "ja": "あっ、そう言えば……記念公演の映像を\n撮ってるって言ってたよネ？　モグモグ……。", "zh": "啊，说起来……你不是说在拍纪念公演的录像吗？嚼嚼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "3af1b8df94d52e20403ed64d2b4eba8c76ae9b2c933fb32782bc1bd894306246", "ja": "そ、それって……私たちがお菓子休憩してるところが、\nバッチリ撮れちゃったってことですか？", "zh": "那、那就是说……我们吃点心休息的样子，被清清楚楚地拍下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "420a4d3ef41e9eef95ca456c4a87952759a29374e6e35a9eb342276a10b2e5a7", "ja": "このままだと私達、\n食いしん坊キャラだと思われちゃう……！？", "zh": "这样下去，我们会被当成贪吃的人设了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1010_032emi", "source_sha256": "ff375cbe86493e563c4781a2fc9d4c1db6016d0a3e135bd4c17790fc227e8778", "ja": "あ、あの、ごヒイキ様方！　違うんです！\n私たち、先ほどまでお稽古をしていて、その……！", "zh": "啊、那个，各位贵客！不是这样的！我们刚才一直在排练，所以……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "73be9f368a35bd93f34688c4e6a9ae51f7cec9d7d69e40c5d824797646274888", "ja": "こうなったら、レッスンを見てもらうしかないヨ！\n早く食べちゃオ、モグモグモグ……！", "zh": "既然这样，就只能请您看看我们的练习了哟！\n快点吃掉吧，嚼嚼嚼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1012_jimaku", "source_sha256": "0b74203627cdc8495c233f711cf6645f7b19e7cd8b5972cddee4482526181409", "ja": "アイドルとしての、『あなたの輝き』とは？", "zh": "作为偶像，『你的光芒』是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1691653eff505b02a059085b0010d71d1b5e8bc4c15475c0a8ccaa3be905a0ea", "ja": "あの、もしかして……お色気とか、\nセクシーとか、そういうのが期待されてます……？", "zh": "那个，难道说……大家期待的是艳丽风，\n或是性感之类的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "12ffc5b7079b1cabfffede0049b0bd2713fccfa5ab8e2c6f3a08f7dbe619a7ba", "ja": "需要があるのはわかりますけど、私はやっぱり、\n清純派がいいなぁ……よ、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "我知道有人需要这种风格，可我果然还是想走清纯路线……请、请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "27699e48a30ba96fe0c3e082552af43b116dfe6b3da70318cdaa79a962a0b7de", "ja": "私、まだまだ未熟者ですが……。\n大和撫子に憧れる気持ちだけは、誰にも負けません！", "zh": "我还有很多不足之处……。\n但对大和抚子的向往之情，绝不输给任何人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "37a74ff3de0d51f4d6025b98522599d406e0f361b00b3f4f9239e68b44cc2395", "ja": "はっ……！　あまり自己主張しすぎるのは、\nはしたなかったでしょうか……？", "zh": "哈……！刚才是不是表现得太过于强调自己，有点失礼了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "1e54a1eac42de23a08751d2fc5b31028055c55d69f1be6caf8ce6bbacf8f65ce", "ja": "ウーン……あのネ、劇場のみんなとダンスしてると、\n全部がキラキラして見えるノ！", "zh": "嗯……那个呀，和剧场的大家一起跳舞的时候，感觉一切都在闪闪发光呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "6840f981659f89c3dde5362bb380ab2c370c11d1ca8f5aab576722c0078b7146", "ja": "だから、そのとき一緒に踊ってるワタシも、\n同じくらいキラキラしてるんじゃないかナ？　エヘヘ♪", "zh": "所以，那个时候一起跳舞的我，是不是也同样闪闪发光呢？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "50efb64a70b6b20a6f1d39f94c4481600c904aad8be025936290d2ea274e6db2", "ja": "私は、ええと……歌やダンスがすっごく得意って\nわけじゃないし、特別美少女ではないし……。", "zh": "我呢，那个……也不是特别擅长唱歌跳舞，\n也不是什么特别漂亮的美少女……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "633513fc8a42057174180bdb391487d4a78fba5874e4f96c019f8d0d061d5131", "ja": "でも……えへへ♪　そんな普通なところを、\n応援してもらえて……それが私の『輝き』かなって！", "zh": "不过……嘿嘿♪ 能得到大家为我这样普通的一面加油……我觉得，这就是我的“光芒”吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0241_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_03_1021_null", "source_sha256": "fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9", "ja": "ありがとうございました！", "zh": "谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
